{"4654450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SOS! Love~Controlled", "steam_appid": 4654450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/bbfe3a7925350399f8a3b67cfda6663f.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=316 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/1bc353c4979269bf866711c387a222cc.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends film-style audiovisual storytelling with romance, psychological suspense, and light sci-fi elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make will affect the characters’ feelings toward you and lead the story down different paths...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original BGM and songs specially produced by music creators further enrich the atmosphere and emotional experience of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/844f243b7f4eb4ec8d86aa7ade08cb73.poster.avif?t=1785678033\" width=960 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/844f243b7f4eb4ec8d86aa7ade08cb73.webm?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/844f243b7f4eb4ec8d86aa7ade08cb73.mp4?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/db942b4c477553816126a7e55711bbd2.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cast of female characters with emotional growth arcs, each carrying their own personality, secrets, and emotional scars, alongside complete stories of encounter, collapse, and redemption.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiyori: A wealthy daughter hiding her otaku identity. Behind her glamorous facade lies a loveless life—only you can save her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naomi: The big-sister type who runs an underground ACG bar. Her broken life is waiting for you to piece back together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruina: A closed-off and sensitive Lolita girl. Unlock her sealed heart—you are the only one she can lean on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai: A silent, beautiful girl from another dimension. Bound by countless cosmic threads, she travels across light-years—just for you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And also...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veloceia:A dangerous yet charming antagonist. To control or be controlled—the choice is yours.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And of course:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orso: your reliable(?) and comedic best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/7b30286306246c7e2a7f99261176f856.poster.avif?t=1785678033\" width=960 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/7b30286306246c7e2a7f99261176f856.webm?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/7b30286306246c7e2a7f99261176f856.mp4?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/dd6ec1930acbf5b2c2dd154ecd724fff.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as an ordinary encounter gradually slips into abnormal dimensions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A road-movie-like journey unfolds through time travel, montage-style scene transitions, and a story blending suspense with light sci-fi elements.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond romance, the story is ultimately about emotional salvation, identity, and the complete emotional collapse that follows.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/a15c24798d357a82968380e39ac06ae2.poster.avif?t=1785678033\" width=960 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/a15c24798d357a82968380e39ac06ae2.webm?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/a15c24798d357a82968380e39ac06ae2.mp4?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/c77a1c8ba263365d0073839a2091512b.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense QTE battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passionate romance scenes and seductive encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and fun mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/fa32d3035c7f749b44767825c3a3f7c7.poster.avif?t=1785678033\" width=960 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/fa32d3035c7f749b44767825c3a3f7c7.webm?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/fa32d3035c7f749b44767825c3a3f7c7.mp4?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/1bc353c4979269bf866711c387a222cc.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends film-style audiovisual storytelling with romance, psychological suspense, and light sci-fi elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make will affect the characters’ feelings toward you and lead the story down different paths...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original BGM and songs specially produced by music creators further enrich the atmosphere and emotional experience of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/844f243b7f4eb4ec8d86aa7ade08cb73.poster.avif?t=1785678033\" width=960 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/844f243b7f4eb4ec8d86aa7ade08cb73.webm?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/844f243b7f4eb4ec8d86aa7ade08cb73.mp4?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/db942b4c477553816126a7e55711bbd2.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cast of female characters with emotional growth arcs, each carrying their own personality, secrets, and emotional scars, alongside complete stories of encounter, collapse, and redemption.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiyori: A wealthy daughter hiding her otaku identity. Behind her glamorous facade lies a loveless life—only you can save her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naomi: The big-sister type who runs an underground ACG bar. Her broken life is waiting for you to piece back together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruina: A closed-off and sensitive Lolita girl. Unlock her sealed heart—you are the only one she can lean on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai: A silent, beautiful girl from another dimension. Bound by countless cosmic threads, she travels across light-years—just for you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And also...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veloceia:A dangerous yet charming antagonist. To control or be controlled—the choice is yours.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And of course:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orso: your reliable(?) and comedic best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/7b30286306246c7e2a7f99261176f856.poster.avif?t=1785678033\" width=960 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/7b30286306246c7e2a7f99261176f856.webm?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/7b30286306246c7e2a7f99261176f856.mp4?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/dd6ec1930acbf5b2c2dd154ecd724fff.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as an ordinary encounter gradually slips into abnormal dimensions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A road-movie-like journey unfolds through time travel, montage-style scene transitions, and a story blending suspense with light sci-fi elements.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond romance, the story is ultimately about emotional salvation, identity, and the complete emotional collapse that follows.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/a15c24798d357a82968380e39ac06ae2.poster.avif?t=1785678033\" width=960 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/a15c24798d357a82968380e39ac06ae2.webm?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/a15c24798d357a82968380e39ac06ae2.mp4?t=1785678033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654450/extras/c77a1c8ba263365d0073839a2091512b.avif?t=1785678033\" width=1500 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense QTE battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passionate romance scenes and seductive encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and fun mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c